      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOAH'S BEST (2) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage 3 lengths away in second (27.70). Consistent performer from this draw with a win and six minor placings to his credit. Deserves serious consideration. JUNEAU SANGRIA (8) comes off an average performance last start when sixth at this track over 485m behind Dynamite Eric (28.06) in a Grade 5. The form from his last run stacks up well. Expected to give a good account. PAW CHRISTIE (7) was an on speed winner in quick time two back then gave a start but got home into the frame when third at Warrnambool (25.72) last time. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to be in the finish again. CACKLING SUZIE (4) warrants respect although new to this track.",
